  "description": "MIHHIX crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group I 41/a. Reported CIF formula moiety: C76 H40 F36 La4 N8 O20. From the CIF bond table, La1 (La) has 7 O neighbors; La2 (La) has 7 O neighbors; La3 (La) has 7 O neighbors; La4 (La) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 4.013-4.203 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 105.47-113.76°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C76H40N8O20F36La4.",
